# Tests only on explicit TEST

Do not create, update, expand, or regenerate tests (unit, integration, e2e, or snapshots) for this project.

Only write or change tests when the user message includes the exact trigger word `TEST`.

When building features without `TEST`:
- Implement production code only
- Skip test files, test scripts, and test config changes that exist only to support new tests
- Do not offer to add tests unless asked
